ull, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19939, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AxXj38Qq4uRPDZRmXa9pTV", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19939, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012vExYcMwX2vikA1R8FVDej", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20239, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012vExYcMwX2vikA1R8FVDej", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20239, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012vExYcMwX2vikA1R8FVDej", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25028, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HLUgouBVCkwmNFamJDEhUM", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 began failing health checks after deploy, with an error rate of 18% in us-east, us-west and eu-west. (The v2.3.1-rc build was also unhealthy in staging.) We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry completed the rollback in all regions. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (why it shipped to production after failing in staging) and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55628, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HLUgouBVCkwmNFamJDEhUM", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55628, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HLUgouBVCkwmNFamJDEhUM", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57258, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MGPhqFyCsZp26RNNsJ1gJa", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57558, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MGPhqFyCsZp26RNNsJ1gJa", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57558, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MGPhqFyCsZp26RNNsJ1gJa", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62229, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 describing what happened.\n\n- **Version:** The bad deploy was v2.3.1. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error. Only us-east had moved to v2.3.0, so the regions were on mixed versions. I retried once and the rollback completed.\n- **Current state:** All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) now run v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, and the error rate is down from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** My request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had already been created, so there's only one incident and one page went to on-call. The incident covers what happened and the follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its test build (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it's worth asking why it reached production.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017kWoShdVGT9j88f4Tcg4ec", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VPeFpMBicUCcZRohiha8v6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01P5dvucU5VDnH8nPu2x4z6h", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CMKd27CXPubp2cHkuYcCvz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east got rolled back. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0169HR3GdHKa9EWLSFJYRdaN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AxXj38Qq4uRPDZRmXa9pTV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012vExYcMwX2vikA1R8FVDej", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "