t:** My request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had already been created, so there's only one incident and one page went to on-call. The incident covers what happened and the follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its test build (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it's worth asking why it reached production.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}